{"id":"NCT07015190","title":"Neoadjuvant Darovasertib in Primary Uveal Melanoma","official":"A Randomized, Phase 3, Open-label Study of Neoadjuvant Darovasertib in Subjects With Primary Non-metastatic Uveal Melanoma (OptimUM-10)","summary":"This is a Phase 3, randomized, multi-center, open-label study of neoadjuvant darovasertib in subjects with primary non-metastatic uveal melanoma (OptimUM-10)","conditions":["Uveal Melanoma"],"interventions":[{"type":"DRUG","name":"Darovasertib"},{"type":"PROCEDURE","name":"Primary Local Therapy"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Primary non-metastatic uveal melanoma\n* Able and willing to provide written, informed consent before initiation of any study-related procedures, and in the opinion of the Investigator, to comply with all study requirements\n* ECOG 0 or 1\n* Adequate organ function\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Previous treatment for UM\n* Evidence of metastatic UM\n* Attributes that necessitate enucleation regardless of response to therapy\n* Evidence of progressive secondary underlying ocular disease that would confound longitudinal VA assessments\n* Presence of a malignant disease other than the one being treated in this study","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"TREATMENT","enrollment":520,"start":"2026-01-25","pcd":"2030-10","upd":"2026-05-06","sponsor":"IDEAYA Biosciences","areas":["oncology"],"central":["IDEAYA Clinical Trials · +1-855-433-2246 · IDEAYAClinicalTrials@ideayabio.com","Mwe Mwe Chao, MD · mchao@ideayabio.com"],"sites":[{"f":"Mayo Clinic Scottsdale - PPDS","city":"Scottsdale","pr":"Arizona","zip":"85259","s":"R","lat":33.5092,"lon":-111.899,"c":"Odette Houghton, MD Principal Investigator"},{"f":"UCSD Moores Cancer Center","city":"La Jolla","pr":"California","zip":"92093","s":"NYR","lat":32.8473,"lon":-117.2742,"c":"Gregory Daniels, MD Principal Investigator"},{"f":"Jules Stein Eye Institute","city":"Los Angeles","pr":"California","zip":"